          },
          "description": "The Soundtrekkers pick up on the ghostly sounds of creaking and groaning, and head to the Bermuda Triangle to investigate. When they arrive, they record the sounds of a sunken wooden sailing ship, but after gathering what they need, the crew hears some destructive crashing sounds coming from inside the ship. As it turns out, it’s the muddling menace Clam Hands, an otherwise ordinary dude with clams for hands turning the sunken ship upside-down in search of treasure! When the Seven Cs Solver app suggests CURIOSITY, the Soundtrekkers invite Clam Hands to play a game to convince him that maybe there’s a better place to go treasure hunting!",
